{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021074747301-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021114537\"/><p>意外涉及客貨車及校巴。</p><p>西隧發生交通意外。今晨（21日）7時55分，一輛校巴在九龍沿西區海底隧道往港島方向行駛，期間在快線近入口前，與前方一輛客貨車首尾相撞。事件中無學童受傷，客貨車司機腳部受傷，意外原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T04:20:36.127556+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T23:47:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T05:17:58.554454+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T04:18:08.092922+00:00","content_hash":"d1e202e0911cc519b84d843fa3d356a874035900d2224ded81a4f551d8c71707","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}